<title>FRANCE: Pechiney 1996 sales down four percent.</title>
<headline>Pechiney 1996 sales down four percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					64,372    vs   67,060</p>
<p>of which:</p>
<p>     Aluminium				    20,317    vs   22,609</p>
<p>     Packaging				    23,382    vs   22,737</p>
<p>     Other industrial activity		 3,010    vs    3,303</p>
<p>     International trade			17,663    vs   18,411</p>
<p>    Fourth quarter turnover		   15,287    vs   16,027</p>
<p>    Pechiney International		    23,895    vs   23,377</p>
<p>NOTE -- The 1995 figures were restated to take account of asset sales. Pechiney gave the figures in a statement.</p>
<p>Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
